  "limitations": [
    "Macro-Level Resolution: Predictions reflect district-wide baseline requirements for an average field cultivating that crop under standard soil conditions, not field-specific sensor prescriptions.",
    "Soil Aggregation: Features reflect regional Soil Health Card nutrient index distributions rather than a single plot's laboratory assay.",
    "STCR Modulation: For field-level deployment, predicted district baselines must be modulated by +/- 25% based on farmer-specific soil test rating (Low/Medium/High) and organic manure credits.",
    "Weather Coverage: Authentic weather features are currently active for Pune, Maharashtra. Expansion across other Indian districts requires continuous ingestion via NASA POWER API."
